{"name":"【构图-例10】形断气连","thumbnail":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","camera":{"pos":[-10.08,9.071,58.578],"target":[-0.785,-2.347,7.335],"zoom":0.52},"light":{"type":"rect","azimuth":125,"elevation":52,"distance":40,"temp":33,"size":1,"intensity":6.7},"env":{"hasWall":false,"defaultMat":"origin","posterizeLevel":0,"wallColor":"#cccccc","groundColor":"#278b33","skyColor":"#0d0d0f","skyLightScale":0.26,"atmosphere":{"enabled":false,"density":0.01,"type":"height","color":"#ffffff","p1":4.3,"p2":1.1},"dof":{"enabled":false,"aperture":2.9,"focusDistance":10},"lightIndicatorEnabled":false},"crop":{"display":"block","left":"556.6px","top":"78.2px","width":"600px","height":"600px"},"items":[{"type":"builtin","shape":"cube","pos":[0,2.691,1.267],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[0.504,1.794,0.504],"color":"#28d745"},{"type":"builtin","shape":"cube","pos":[2.149,1.789,0],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[0.504,1.193,0.504],"color":"#28d745"},{"type":"builtin","shape":"cube","pos":[5.763,1.72,0],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[0.504,1.146,0.504],"color":"#2be34a"},{"type":"builtin","shape":"cube","pos":[-6.991,2.575,1.965],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[0.504,1.716,0.504],"color":"#28d745"},{"type":"builtin","shape":"cube","pos":[7.853,1.291,-0.312],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[0.504,0.861,0.504],"color":"#2ae549"},{"type":"builtin","shape":"cube","pos":[-4.72,5.797,15.9],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[1.012,3.865,1.224],"color":"#ec4bb1","annotations":[{"id":"anno_1785161496409_14","annotationKind":"leader","text":"① 先立意\n主题《形断气连》。物象受前景遮挡，形体外观看似断裂分隔；群组内在高低起伏的韵律一脉相承，形体虽断，气韵持续贯通。\n② 达共识\n全部棱柱共处同一空间，共用统一光源与空间规则。\n③ 造冲突\n前景紫红色棱柱横亘在前，直观上将后方绿色柱阵截断分割，制造序列断裂、形体被割裂的视觉冲突。色彩互补强对比。\n④ 驯冲突\n以前景紫红色棱柱为主体，后方绿色柱群为宾，主次分明、以宾衬主；柱群高低错落排布，形成连绵起伏的节奏与律动美感；绿柱纵然被遮挡隔断，群组内在脉络依旧延续，实现形断而气不断的整体气韵贯通。红柱和绿柱的色彩因互补而统一，它们的高低起伏态势也做到了相互制衡抵消以达到整体平衡。","textRich":"① 先立意\n主题《形断气连》。物象受前景遮挡，形体外观看似断裂分隔；群组内在高低起伏的韵律一脉相承，形体虽断，气韵持续贯通。\n② 达共识\n全部棱柱共处同一空间，共用统一光源与空间规则。\n③ 造冲突\n前景紫红色棱柱横亘在前，直观上将后方绿色柱阵截断分割，制造序列断裂、形体被割裂的视觉冲突。色彩互补强对比。\n④ 驯冲突\n以前景紫红色棱柱为主体，后方绿色柱群为宾，<strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 36, 36);\">主次</strong>分明、以宾衬主；柱群高低错落排布，形成连绵起伏的<strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 36, 36);\">节奏与律动美感</strong>；绿柱纵然被遮挡隔断，群组内在脉络依旧延续，实现<strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 36, 36);\">形断而气不断</strong>的整体<strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 36, 36);\">气韵贯通</strong>。红柱和绿柱的<strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 36, 36);\">色彩因互补而统一</strong>，它们的高低起伏态势也做到了相互制衡抵消以达到整体平衡。","detailText":"","collapsed":true,"color":"#4d4d4d","dx":22.324539195361695,"dy":-47.08990864597894,"dxN":0.012919,"dyN":-0.045497,"dxW":1.011011,"dyW":-2.132559,"localPos":[0.8293,1.4193,1.5],"localNormal":[0,0,1],"baseDist":40.841522677362164,"baseScale":1.012}]},{"type":"builtin","shape":"cube","pos":[12.207,2.075,1.663],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[0.504,1.383,0.504],"color":"#2cdd4a"},{"type":"builtin","shape":"cube","pos":[0.74,3.344,17.769],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[1.012,2.229,1.224],"color":"#ff42cd"},{"type":"builtin","shape":"cube","pos":[-2.787,2.972,-0.25],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[0.624,1.981,0.638],"color":"#2ed64a"},{"type":"builtin","shape":"cube","pos":[-4.862,2.744,0.495],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[0.504,1.829,0.504],"color":"#2ed64a"},{"type":"builtin","shape":"cube","pos":[5.033,1.772,-3.255],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[0.504,1.181,0.504],"color":"#2adf48"},{"type":"builtin","shape":"cube","pos":[11.14,1.447,-1.054],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[0.504,0.965,0.504],"color":"#33e651"},{"type":"builtin","shape":"cube","pos":[14.385,4.635,2.422],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[0.504,3.09,0.504],"color":"#2ed64a"},{"type":"builtin","shape":"cube","pos":[16.367,1.363,1.469],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[0.504,0.909,0.504],"color":"#2dd248"},{"type":"builtin","shape":"cube","pos":[-9.509,2.055,-0.434],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[0.504,1.37,0.504],"color":"#23d140"},{"type":"builtin","shape":"cube","pos":[-11.788,1.681,1.368],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[0.504,1.12,0.504],"color":"#29d646"},{"type":"builtin","shape":"cube","pos":[-13.827,1.114,-2.404],"rot":[0,0,0],"scale":[0.504,0.743,0.504],"color":"#29db47"},{"type":"builtin","shape":"cube","pos":[-17.382,0.803,-2.